{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o027a","title":"诸葛亮论法正若在可制止东征","accounts":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o027a-account","label":"《庞统法正传第七》正文","text":"章武二年刘备败还白帝后，诸葛亮追叹法正若在或能阻止东征、免于倾危；不把假设当成已经发生。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o027a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"追论","evidence":["pangfa-e-o027a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":222,"label":"章武二年败还白帝后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"pangfa-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"pangfa-q-o027","basis":"章武二年败还白帝后"},"evidence":["pangfa-e-o027a-q","pangfa-q-o027","wuzhu-q-o054","guanzhang-q-o034","guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5"]},"ordering_evidence":"pangfa-e-o027a-q","source_order":[37,153,"O027a"],"order":7002}],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。马超的祠墓遗址，相传在今四川成都市新都区城南的马超小学内，曾有墓碑出土。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1fcace810489e51a4218","start":0,"end":56},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o034","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-7ddd1fa08ce5c9feb1d4","layer":"original","quote":"二年卒〖13〗，时年四十七。临没上疏曰：“臣门宗二百余口〖14〗，为孟德所诛略尽〖15〗；惟有从弟岱，当为微宗血食之继〖16〗，深托陛下。余无复言。”","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75},{"id":"pangfa-e-o027a-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-6b23f8730a9cef243526","layer":"original","quote":"章武二年，大军败绩，还住白帝。亮叹曰：“法孝直若在，则能制主上，令不东行；就复东行，必不倾危矣！”","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":61,"end":110},{"id":"pangfa-q-o027","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-6b23f8730a9cef243526","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮与正，虽好尚不同〖31〗，以公义相取〖32〗；亮每奇正智术。先主既即尊号，将东征孙权以复关羽之耻，群臣多谏，一不从。章武二年，大军败绩，还住白帝。亮叹曰：“法孝直若在，则能制主上，令不东行；就复东行，必不倾危矣！”﹝四﹞","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o054","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7e0fdf82962252602cbd","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年春正月〖1〗，陆逊部将军宋谦等〖2〗，攻蜀五屯；皆破之，斩其将。三月，鄱阳言黄龙现〖3〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
